+# Scene2 dual-block pilot
+
+Claim: 4 layouts x 2 instructions = 8 condition episodes; not eight independent scenes. R3 local; reproduce-pending.
+
+Layout pre-screen: 240/240 seeds; 240 unique layouts; red/blue 120 left/120 right; yaw 30-75; not an expert success rate.
+
+Baseline: 12 scenes, 2 s hold, max drift 2e-9 m, threshold 2 mm.
+
+Physical pilot: 4/8; layout 3 passed both; 4/4 initial fingerprints match. Failures: pick_close tray contact 2 (0.61/0.74 mm), place_release 0.83 mm, place_withdraw no direction. Targets were placed and distractors moved <3e-9 m in the place failures. Arm split: red-left 0/2, red-right 2/2, blue-left 1/2, blue-right 1/2; small pilot, no language or arm claim. Formal collection not started; fix clearance first.
+
+[pilot](../experiments/so101/scene2-dual-random-pilot.json) · [audit](../experiments/so101/scene2-dual-random-audit.json) · [engineering](so101-scene2-dual-random-engineering.md) · [images](assets/so101-scene2-dual-random/layout_03_red_vs_blue.png).
